/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1ccfccdfff445250END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-96c8f05818f88324END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_TheApprenticesCompanion4</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_TheApprenticesCompanion4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SorcerousSundries_TheApprenticesCompanion4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">11e7e6fc-9094-476b-b0e6-fa5d33f44a62</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11e7e6fc-9094-476b-b0e6-fa5d33f44a62\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11e7e6fc-9094-476b-b0e6-fa5d33f44a62\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Potentially sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/25px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/38px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/50px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/25px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\">Tolna Tome-Monger</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Uses of Magic for Particular Quandaries\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nTo reveal invisible traps: Use <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\">Faerie Fire</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\">See Invisibility</a>.\n</p><p><br>\nTo bypass <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding\" title=\"Glyph of Warding\">glyphs</a>: Use <a href=\"/wiki/Fly\" title=\"Fly\">Fly</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Form\" title=\"Gaseous Form\">Gaseous Form</a>\n</p><p><br>\nTo block harmful spells that <a href=\"/wiki/Trap\" title=\"Trap\">traps</a> may trigger: Use <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is part of a series of books about magical phenomenons, creatures and spells:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style